Overlays the toolbar's home_surface_search_box_background: Lemur's
"Search_default" input: 48dp pill, 2dp outline in the text colour, no fill
(lemur_bg_ntp_search_box). ComposeplateUtils.applyWhiteBackground() may
mutate the fill to white on image themes; the outline is kept.
-->
<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shape="rectangle">
    <solid android:color="@android:color/transparent" />
    <stroke
        android:width="2dp"
        android:color="@color/lemurx_ntp_outline" />
    <corners android:radius="@dimen/lemurx_ntp_search_box_radius" />
</shape>
